mages.ddowiki.com/thumb/The_Mistfallen_%28item%29.png/420px-The_Mistfallen_%28item%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"634\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/The_Mistfallen_%28item%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0004100000</span>4,100<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">3 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\"><b><a href=\"/page/Fresh-baked_Dreams\" title=\"Fresh-baked Dreams\">Fresh-baked Dreams</a></b>, End chest, Mill Chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Enhancements\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Orb Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Orb Bonus</a>:</b> While this <a href=\"/page/Orb\" title=\"Orb\">orb</a> is equipped and you are actively blocking, you gain a +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">orb bonus</a> to all <a href=\"/page/Saving_throw\" title=\"Saving throw\">saving throws</a>, as well as <a href=\"/page/Energy_Resistance\" title=\"Energy Resistance\">Acid, Cold, Fire, Electric, and Sonic resistances</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Diversion\" title=\"Diversion\">Insightful Mystic Diversion +4%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Diversion\" title=\"Diversion\">Insightful Mystic Diversion +4%</a>:</b> +4% <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to decreased threat generated from spell damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus_Mastery\" title=\"Spell Focus Mastery\">Insightful Spell Focus Mastery +1</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus_Mastery\" title=\"Spell Focus Mastery\">Insightful Spell Focus Mastery +1</a>:</b> +1 Insight bonus to the DC of all spells.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Illusory_Death\" title=\"Illusory Death\">Illusory Death 1</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Illusory_Death\" title=\"Illusory Death\">Illusory Death 1</a>:</b> Increases your <a href=\"/page/Caster_level\" title=\"Caster level\">caster level</a> when casting <a href=\"/page/Illusion\" title=\"Illusion\">illusion</a> and <a href=\"/page/Necromancy\" title=\"Necromancy\">necromancy</a> spells by 1.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Efficient_Metamagic\" title=\"Efficient Metamagic\">Efficient Metamagic - Empower II</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Efficient_Metamagic\" title=\"Efficient Metamagic\">Efficient Metamagic - Empower II</a>:</b> The additional <a href=\"/page/Spell_point\" title=\"Spell point\">spell point</a> cost for using the <a href=\"/page/Empower_Spell\" title=\"Empower Spell\">Empower</a> Metamagic feat is reduced by 2 <a href=\"/page/Spell_point\" title=\"Spell point\">SP</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.tit